{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10205","headline":"题游仙阁白公庙 · 李嘉佑","name":"题游仙阁白公庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙冠轻举竟何之，薜荔缘堦竹映祠。\n甲子不知风驭日，朝昏唯见雨来时。\n霓旌翠盖终难遇，流水青山空所思。\n逐客自怜双鬓改，梵香多负白云期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}